{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1403122-artifact-development-aid-sought","id":1403122,"title":"Artifact Development Aid Sought","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-16T11:02:24-07:00","id":1403122,"title":"Artifact Development Aid Sought","content":"The concept is straightforward: A dull-finished iron toolkit, which when attuned opens up, and up, and up, until it's a full-blown smithy, which gives the normal bonuses for exceptional equipment, with living space above the shop. But I have no idea what it should cost to attune, or what level it should be, or even what exotic components it might need. Variants for other crafts are possible, but the maker of this one is primarily a blacksmith.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1184,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","user":"LadyLens","date":". 07-16-2020, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T11:51:53-07:00","id":1403135,"title":"","content":"It doesn't sound meaningfully stronger than the Traveler's Staff from Core, so I'd go with roughly the same stats:<br /> -2 Dots<br /> -3 motes commitment only while the smithy is up (no need to keep it attuned while it's in tookit form).<br /> <br /> <u>Possible materials:</u><br /> -Moonsilver because Shapeshifting<br /> -White Jade because a portable smithy has associations with the element of Earth<br /> -Unrefined Starmetal because it ressembles ordinary iron<br /> -Leftover scrap metal from Alveua's forge or any similar weird material linked to smithing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T12:06:47-07:00","id":1403138,"title":"","content":"Thank you, Epitome. That was extremely helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T03:03:29-07:00","id":1403201,"title":"","content":"It's providing shelter and exceptional crafting equipment. That doesn't seem beyond what you could get with a decent toolkit and a nice tent. Let's assume the fire is always hot and the forge is ready to go (maybe conditional on restocking consumables), and as Epitome said it's a solid 2 dots/3m.<br /> <br /> It's your game, have fun, if that's what you want then that's what you want. It's certainly a neat little miracle.<br /> <br /> But if you wanted to think bigger...<br /> <br /> What if you could use the living space to store your stuff, like a Portable Hole from D&amp;D? What if the workshop offered Evocations to help you Craft? What if the workshop was <i>alive</i> and helped you craft, but maybe complained if you kept it couped up in toolbox form for too long? What if it's a Howl' s Moving Castle type deal, where the toolbox allows instant transportation to a vast crafting facility? Ooo ooo! Remember the old Mobile Repair and Fabrication Platform from Wonders of the Lost Age?<br /> <br /> If you wanted to make this a four dot artifact, there's plenty of room to power up this idea.<br /> <br /> For materials...<br /> <br /> Orichalcum is the metal of the King of Crafters. White Jade has associations with Crafting (and also stablity). Moonsilver (and Black Jade) with change. Malfean iron from a renown forge of hell. Firmin ichor?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}